            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838975?u=072d3c7faa423d3b5caed84359d35fa29574412b&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/54838975/423096225-8620a34f-e076-4967-8572-e8b033748c5c.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..KjvOoRmVOLcY8kbL4hCH50KlrbnZfJdYv0XqyLeQCrc\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/54838975/423096225-8620a34f-e076-4967-8572-e8b033748c5c.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..KjvOoRmVOLcY8kbL4hCH50KlrbnZfJdYv0XqyLeQCrc\" alt=\"image\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a><br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/54838975/423096282-10e3a68d-bc25-48aa-ad6f-d33cd033316f.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..NHV0lhk-QlpKqELBtH-rH_AiNiM8xkItq2hKrITVryk\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/54838975/423096282-10e3a68d-bc25-48aa-ad6f-d33cd033316f.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..NHV0lhk-QlpKqELBtH-rH_AiNiM8xkItq2hKrITVryk\" alt=\"image\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a><br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/54838975/423096417-0f6b2be9-b722-485e-b8a0-217fe770f3f3.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..3lSlcbAjOWujXodSDhVNf-LS6Z94HD8yvb_pnB7CqI0\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/54838975/423096417-0f6b2be9-b722-485e-b8a0-217fe770f3f3.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..3lSlcbAjOWujXodSDhVNf-LS6Z94HD8yvb_pnB7CqI0\" alt=\"image\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">using <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/time\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;time&gt;</code></a> tag helps with accessibility, e.g screen reader.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">see: <a href=\"https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2020/12/making-time-more-accessible/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2020/12/making-time-more-accessible/</a></p>",
