        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838975?u=072d3c7faa423d3b5caed84359d35fa29574412b&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">adds <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/HTML/Element/time\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;time&gt;</code></a> tag in order to be more accessible. will do <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/time#attributes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">datetime</code></a> attribute in following PR.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Rationale</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2020/12/making-time-more-accessible/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2020/12/making-time-more-accessible/</a></p>",
